{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16940","headline":"秋晚途次坊州界寄崔玉员外 · 武元衡","name":"秋晚途次坊州界寄崔玉员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崎岖崖谷迷，寒雨暮成泥。\n征路出山顶，乱云生马蹄。\n望乡程杳杳，怀远思凄凄。\n欲识分麾重，孤城万壑西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}